<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">          
</span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span>E<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Над
каналами
свет погас<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        
</span>E<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">               
