"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                 
</span><span class="SpellE"><span class="GramE">Am</span></span><span class="GramE"><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span>E</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Вынь,
<span class="GramE">браток</span>,
из кармана
фугас<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">       </span><span class="SpellE">Am</span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">             
</span></span><span class="SpellE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Am</span></span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Я в
крутую
жировку не
верую<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        
</span>A7<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">             
</span>Dm<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Нам
не светит
объятий и
ласк<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span>Dm<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">             
</span><span class="SpellE">Am</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>На
запоры
закрытые
двери<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span>E<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">             
</span><span class="SpellE">Am</span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> 
</span>E<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Наши
жены уснули
без нас<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Проигрыш</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>: <o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
